# SigmaOS .gitignore policy
# *.md files (except README.md) are kept in GitHub Wikis, not main branch
# This keeps repositories clean and follows the Omarchy Linux model

/target
Cargo.lock
*.swp
/target/

# Wiki documentation - moved to GitHub Wikis
# All .md files except README.md should be in Wikis, not tracked in git
# If you need to add a new .md file, create a wiki entry instead

# *.md
# !README.md
